INTENT / WHY

A reusable possible-worlds laboratory. Compose arbitrary actors across time, scale, ecology, civilization, technology, mythology, and fiction; place them in any causal environment; give them agency or pseudo-agency; compare synthetic outcomes under altered conditions; render one immutable world/event history through different observation/interpretation lenses; calibrate only where actual matched independent evidence exists. Support serious hypothesis testing AND free imaginative play without confusing one with the other.

